	•	Section 2 Comments/Quotes: The waitlist analysis included “13,204 candidates,” and the post-transplant analysis included “20,763 adult transplant recipients.” Table 1 reports female sex as 41% in the baseline waitlist cohort. Race/ethnicity was reported, and multiple clinical factors were included, such as diagnosis group, 6-minute walk distance, respiratory support, pulmonary arterial pressure, oxygen use, creatinine, BMI, bilirubin, insurance, and education. A single overall mean age for the full analytic cohorts was not reported in the retrieved text.

